:: Widgets Fae [widget]

<<widget "passoutfae">>
    You've pushed yourself too much.
    <br><br>
    <<passout>>
    <<link [[Lose consciousness|Passout Fae]]>><</link>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "eventfae">>
	<<cleareventpool>>
		<<if beastSexEnabledForType("rabbit", $monster is 1)>>
			<<addevent "faerabbit">>
		<</if>>
		<<if beastSexEnabledForType("dragon", $monster is 1)>>
			<<addevent "faedragon">>
		<</if>>
		<<if $settings.voreEnabled>>
			<<addevent "faedragonvore">>
		<</if>>
		<<if $settings.swarmsEnabled>>
			<<addevent "faefairies">>
		<</if>>
	<<runeventpool>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "eventfaesafe">>
	<<cleareventpool>>
        <<addinlineevent "safefaerabbit">>
			The ground shakes as a rabbit the size of a car leaps and lands, shaking your core. It would be good to keep your guard up around here.<<gstress>><<stress 1>>
			<br><br>

			<<link [[Next|Fae Realm]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
		<</addinlineevent>>
		<<addinlineevent "safefaebutterfly">>
			You find a small grove filled with glowing mushrooms and beautiful butterflies. The sight is inspiring and encourages you to move on.<<llstress>><<stress -5>>
			<br><br>

			<<link [[Next|Fae Realm]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
		<</addinlineevent>>
		<<addinlineevent "safefaesmell">>
			You catch a wiff of an amazing smell. You're unable to narrow it down but it is undeniably something delicious...<<lstress>><<stress -2>>
			<br><br>

			<<link [[Next|Fae Realm]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
		<</addinlineevent>>
		<<addinlineevent "safefaeroar">>
			You hear the roar of something huge in the distance. It would probably be best to keep moving.<<gstress>><<stress 3>>
			<br><br>

			<<link [[Next|Fae Realm]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
		<</addinlineevent>>
		<<addinlineevent "safefaefairies">>
			You catch sight of strange tiny winged creatures that can be nothing other than fairies. As you approach, they disappear from view.<<lstress>><<stress -3>>
			<br><br>

			<<link [[Next|Fae Realm]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
		<</addinlineevent>>
	<<runeventpool>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "faerabbit">>
	<<beastNEWinit 1 rabbit>>
	A lone <<beasttype>> emerges from between the trees, teeth bared.
	<<if $monster is 1>>
		"Breed?" <<bhe>> honks. "Breed. Must breed."
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Fae Rabbit Molestation]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><<set $eventskip to 2>><</link>>
	<br>
<</widget>>

<<widget "faedragon">>
	<<beastNEWinit 1 dragon>>
	A lone <<beasttype>> emerges from the deeper parts of the forest.
	<<if $monster is 1>>
		"I'll add you to my collection," <<bhe>> growls. "Mine."
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Fae Dragon Molestation]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><<set $eventskip to 2>><</link>>
	<br>
<</widget>>

<<widget "faedragonvore">>
	A huge dragon emerges from the mist deep in the forest, its huge body and glistening scales larger than a house. You're intimidated but have no other option as the dragon lunches towards you.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Fae Dragon Vore]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><<set $vorecreature to "dragon">><<set $eventskip to 2>><</link>>
	<br>
<</widget>>

<<widget "faefairies">>
	A cluster of fairies surround you, giggling with luminous butterfly like wings. As you lower your guard, they begin to grab at your body and grab at you.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Fae Fairy Swarm]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><<set $eventskip to 2>><</link>>
	<br>
<</widget>>

<<widget "caveicon">>
	<<icon "cave.png">>
<</widget>>